# src/wasm/ (wasm-pack build output) is intentionally NOT ignored: the app
# has no build step that regenerates it before packaging (frontendDist just
# copies src/ verbatim), so it's committed like paper-full.min.js — a
# vendored build artifact, not something to regenerate on every checkout.
# Re-run `wasm-pack build --target web --out-dir ../src/wasm` from
# geometry-wasm/ after any change to geometry-wasm/src/.
